      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED EYE SAMURAI (3) failed to feature last start after drifting back at this track, but prior to that won by 0.7 lengths at Geelong (22.72) beating Aston Borealis in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 on August 11. Comes through a solid form race last start. Tough to beat if on-song. PINE BLUFF (1) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive three back in her solid 22.24 win at Ballarat over 390m. Top win three back and can measure up again. THERMAL FLICKER (2) has mixed form recently, finishing sixth (26.95) in a Grade 5 at Shepparton latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Can hit the frame this time. PAW MURBELLA (8) is new to this course but warrants respect.",
